---
// Hero.astro — Neo-brutalism
---

<section
  class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 pt-12 sm:pt-16 pb-12 sm:pb-16"
>
  <!-- 顶部标签行 -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-8 nb-pop nb-delay-1">
    <span class="nb-label">Portfolio · 2026</span>
    <span class="nb-status">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Open to opportunities
    </span>
  </div>

  <!-- 主标题块：黄底黑边大方块，名字撑满 -->
  <div class="nb-pop nb-delay-2">
    <div
      class="nb-box nb-shadow px-5 sm:px-8 py-7 sm:py-10"
      style="background: var(--nb-yellow);"
    >
      <p
        class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] sm:text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3"
        style="color: #0a0a0a;"
      >
        Hello — 我是
      </p>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-[clamp(3rem,13vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.85]"
        style="color: #0a0a0a;"
      >
        杨晔塬
      </h1>
      <p
        class="font-display text-[clamp(1.1rem,3.4vw,2rem)] mt-3 leading-tight"
        style="color: #0a0a0a;"
      >
        AI AGENT / 后端开发
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 简介 + 快捷按钮，错位叠在主块下方 -->
  <div
    class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6 nb-pop nb-delay-3"
  >
    <div class="md:col-span-2 nb-box nb-shadow px-5 sm:px-7 py-5 sm:py-6">
      <p
        class="text-[0.95rem] sm:text-base leading-relaxed"
        style="color: var(--color-text-soft);"
      >
        电子科技大学 · 信息与通信工程在读，现于
        <span class="nb-mark font-bold">腾讯</span>
        做
        <span
          class="nb-mark font-bold"
          style="background: var(--nb-blue); color: #fff;">AI Agent 开发</span
        >。做长时 Agent 的执行框架、流程编排与状态恢复，也关心推理 Infra 与后训练。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-5">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/shsaihdsaiudh"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="nb-btn nb-btn-primary"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="15"
            height="15"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path
              d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"
            ></path>
            <path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:2776079516@qq.com" class="nb-btn">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="15"
            height="15"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4"></rect>
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Email</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog" class="nb-btn">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="15"
            height="15"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Journal</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 信息卡：三条并排的实心色块 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div
        class="nb-box nb-shadow-sm px-4 py-3"
        style="background: var(--nb-lilac);"
      >
        <div
          class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase mb-1"
          style="color: #0a0a0a; opacity: 0.7;"
        >
          Currently
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-lg" style="color: #0a0a0a;">
          腾讯 · 实习
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="nb-box nb-shadow-sm px-4 py-3"
        style="background: var(--nb-green);"
      >
        <div
          class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase mb-1"
          style="color: #0a0a0a; opacity: 0.7;"
        >
          School
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-lg" style="color: #0a0a0a;">
          电子科大 · 985
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="nb-box nb-shadow-sm px-4 py-3"
        style="background: var(--nb-red);"
      >
        <div
          class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase mb-1"
          style="color: #0a0a0a; opacity: 0.7;"
        >
          Stack
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-lg" style="color: #0a0a0a;">
          Agent · Java
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
